DISPOSITION (added after CI found the ordering gate)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Every measured budget above passes. The C11.11 checklist box nonetheless stays
UNCHECKED in MASTER.md: tests/core/spec-reconciliation.test.ts (the C11.16
gate) names C11.11 among the items that must remain unchecked while that gate
is open. Weakening that gate to flip the box was refused. The check itself is
